    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113019" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάλιξ</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐκος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ</span> and ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small stone, pebble,</i> in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				213
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστρωμένη χάλιξιν ὁδός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Trag.</u>
					226
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> freq. as
			collect. in sg., <i>gravel, rubble,</i> used in building, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				760
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.290
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Cim.</u>
				13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ χ. καταμείξαντες τὴν
				ἀμμοκονίαν,</span> so as to make <i>concrete,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.4.6
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				839
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. σιδηραῖ</span> dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.314.44
			</span></i>.</div>
